   "t": "In the Claude Monet kitchen, the staff are hungry and waiting for their staff lunch. Max has been assigned to prepare the meal, and line cook Senya asks impatiently when it will be ready. Max proudly promises a gourmet purée soup far superior to the plain slop they usually eat. Listen to their conversation in Russian first, then we will break down each line in English.",
