   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Max, are we going to have lunch today?' The line cook impatiently asks when food will be served.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Конечно, всё уже почти готово!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Of course, everything is already almost ready!' Max reassures the hungry crew in the kitchen.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Мы все очень хотим есть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'We all really want to eat.' The kitchen staff are exhausted and waiting for lunch.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Подождите ещё пару минут.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Wait a couple more minutes.' A polite request to give the cook just a moment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Что ты нам приготовил сегодня?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'What did you prepare for us today?' A curious question about the daily staff meal menu.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я сварил особенный суп-пюре.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I cooked a special purée soup.' Max proudly announces his upscale culinary experiment.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Обычный суп был бы лучше.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'A regular soup would be better.' The veteran cook expresses doubt about fancy experiments.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы все пальчики оближете!",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You will all lick your fingers!' A classic Russian idiom meaning the food is extremely tasty.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Надеюсь, это можно есть.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I hope this is edible.' A teasing remark about the rookie cook's culinary skills.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Вы такого никогда не пробовали.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'You have never tasted such a thing.' Max promises a unique and memorable flavor experience.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "senya",
   "t": "Главное, чтобы было вкусно.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The main thing is that it is tasty.' A practical reminder that taste matters more than presentation.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Это не то обычное месиво.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'This is not that usual slop.' Max contrasts his refined creation with everyday cafeteria food.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
